Register-resident B=1 chains (A/B-row densesym 13/31 + natural-row four-step 32/64/128) plus AoS-loop batched dispatch and the 1e-100 assist-safe map clamp: best wallaby B=1 m=1 0.012–0.078 µs (13→128), batched m=1 0.012–0.092 µs/transform, rel L2 ≤ 2.3e-16 (worst chain gate 2.3e-12 vs 1e-10).
